# Sanity + Vercel env (repo root). Copy to .env.local — never commit secrets.
#
# G3 pull (also used by prebuild):
SANITY_PROJECT_ID=
SANITY_DATASET=production
#
# G4 seed only (Editor token with write — NEVER put this in Vercel):
# SANITY_WRITE_TOKEN=
#
# G5 — Publish → live pipeline (manual, once per project):
# 1. Vercel → Project → Settings → Git → Deploy Hooks → create hook for `main`.
# 2. Sanity Manage → API → Webhooks → POST that URL on create/update/delete
#    of *published* documents only.
# 3. Flow: Studio Publish → webhook → Vercel build (prebuild runs pull) → live.
# 4. Periodically `npm run content` locally and commit so the repo fallback stays fresh.
